@node Formulas Molecules and Epics
@chapter Formulas, Molecules, and Epics
@anchor{formulas}
@cindex formulas
@cindex molecules
@cindex epics

Formulas are YAML or TOML definitions that describe repeatable workflows.
They are @emph{cooked} into proto beads that can then be @emph{poured} (made
persistent) or @emph{wisped} (made ephemeral).  Running instances are
called molecules, and an epic is the larger grouping they roll up to.  This
chapter covers all three and the commands that manage them; the underlying
concepts are introduced in @ref{Molecules and Formulas}.

