@end menu

@node Formulas
@section Formulas
@anchor{formulas-section}
@cindex formula browser

@deffn Command beads-formula-menu
Open the formula menu.  Press @kbd{F} from the dispatch menu
(@pxref{Transients}).
@end deffn

@table @kbd
@item l
List available formulas.  Filter by type (@code{workflow}, @code{expansion},
or @code{aspect}) in the browser, or pass a prefix argument to
@code{beads-formula-browse}.
@item s
Show a formula's details: phase, version, @code{extends}, aspects,
expansion formulas, composition bond points, and each step's type,
dependencies, gate, and waits-for, plus every variable's type, enum,
pattern, default, and required flag.
@item c
Convert a formula from JSON to TOML.
@end table

@vindex beads-formula-scope
The formula browser marks a formula whose name shadows a same-name formula
lower on the @command{bd} search path with a @samp{⧉shad} badge; its
help-echo names the shadowed path.  @code{beads-formula-scope} switches the
scope filter between @code{project}, @code{user}, and @code{all}.

