@node Molecules
@section Molecules
@anchor{molecules-section}
@cindex molecules
@cindex proto

A @emph{proto} is a template epic; a @emph{molecule} is a running instance
made from it.  Press @kbd{m} from the dispatch menu for the molecule menu.

@deffn Command beads-mol
Open the molecule menu: instantiate, combine, inspect, clean up, and
health-check molecules.
@end deffn

