@node Epics
@section Epics
@anchor{epics-section}
@cindex epic status

@deffn Command beads-epic-menu
Open the epic menu.  Press @kbd{E} from the dispatch menu
(@pxref{Transients}).
@end deffn

@table @kbd
@item s
Status overview --- an interactive buffer listing every epic with progress
bars, child counts, and closure eligibility.  @kbd{SPC} expands or collapses
children; @kbd{RET} opens an epic (@pxref{Viewing Issues}).
@item c
Close eligible --- close every epic whose children are all complete.  Pass
@code{--dry-run} to preview first.
@end table

