@node Cook Pour and Burn
@section Cook, Pour, and Burn from One Place
@cindex maintenance menu
@cindex cook
@cindex swarm

The maintenance menu (@kbd{!}) also carries the workflow verbs: @kbd{K}
cook, @kbd{w} swarm, @kbd{g} gate, @kbd{H} ship, and the state helpers
@kbd{z} and @kbd{Z}.  The swarm and gate flows are described in
@ref{Agents and Sling}, and the menu itself is documented with the other
admin commands.
